1060
00:51:56,620 --> 00:51:58,260
And the most entertaining thing for you

1061
00:51:58,260 --> 00:52:00,420
will keep you going, and you're going to get marketed to.

1062
00:52:00,420 --> 00:52:02,620
And there's money there.

1063
00:52:02,620 --> 00:52:05,220
There's money to be made.

1064
00:52:05,220 --> 00:52:07,460
And we're totally competing with that market.

1065
00:52:07,460 --> 00:52:08,780
And I tell you, look out.

1066
00:52:08,780 --> 00:52:09,980
Look out.

1067
00:52:09,980 --> 00:52:13,780
Because the NAB is one powerful organization,

1068
00:52:13,780 --> 00:52:16,220
10 times more, maybe 100 times more powerful

1069
00:52:16,260 --> 00:52:17,780
than the RIAA.

1070
00:52:17,780 --> 00:52:19,820
And once they, that's the record lobby,

1071
00:52:19,820 --> 00:52:22,420
once they know what we're up to,

1072
00:52:22,420 --> 00:52:24,820
it's going to get really, really interesting.

1073
00:52:24,820 --> 00:52:27,100
And they have it, they brought it upon themselves.

1074
00:52:27,100 --> 00:52:28,540
