1248
00:59:23,500 --> 00:59:26,580
And I think that that's fair and everyone understands

1249
00:59:26,580 --> 00:59:29,740
that there's time and money involved in production.

1250
00:59:30,420 --> 00:59:32,860
I think everyone understands that, you know,

1251
00:59:32,860 --> 00:59:35,620
every chimney has to be a smoking.

1252
00:59:35,620 --> 00:59:38,100
So I don't think there's a problem there.

1253
00:59:38,100 --> 00:59:40,780
But let me just give you my two rules of business,

1254
00:59:40,780 --> 00:59:44,260
which I have actually borrowed from a former partner of mine.

1255
00:59:46,380 --> 00:59:49,420
Rule number one, don't negotiate against yourself

1256
00:59:49,420 --> 00:59:50,340
because that's what you're doing.

1257
00:59:50,340 --> 00:59:51,900
Now, granted, you put it out there for us,

1258
00:59:51,900 --> 00:59:53,980
but don't negotiate against yourself.

1259
00:59:53,980 --> 00:59:56,060
And then number two,

1260
00:59:56,060 --> 00:59:58,220
